# Local environments, credentials and caches never belong in an image. The dev image needs tests/, so keep it.
**/.env*
!**/.envrc
**/.venv/
**/.direnv/
**/.aws/
**/.cache/
**/reports/
**/.coverage*
**/htmlcov/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/dist/
budge/_version.py
